## Implementation boundary

These rules govern civica-authored content. The examples use synthetic household information and local preview interactions. They do not add Home Assistant features, change device states or certify safety, accessibility or clinical suitability. Preserve native translations and user-supplied names; verify each proposed message against the actual integration and supported version.
